Lemma u8arr_app2 : forall mm A l1 l2, u8arr bsegs mm A (l1 ++ l2) <-> u8arr bsegs mm A l1 /\ u8arr bsegs mm (A + Z.of_nat (length l1)) l2.
Proof.
  ltac2:(KReplay.run [|constr:(@stdpp.bitvector.definitions.bv); constr:(@Corelib.Numbers.BinNums.Npos); constr:(@Corelib.Numbers.BinNums.xO); constr:(@Corelib.Numbers.BinNums.xH); constr:(@Corelib.Init.Datatypes.option); constr:(@Corelib.Numbers.BinNums.Z); constr:(@Corelib.Init.Datatypes.list); constr:(@Corelib.Init.Logic.iff); constr:(@OSSVerify.Proofs.boost_beast.http_request.lib.Lib.Mem.bytes_at); constr:(@OSSVerify.Proofs.boost_beast.http_request.lib.Bo.BSegs.bsegs); constr:(@Corelib.Init.Datatypes.app); constr:(@Corelib.Init.Logic.and); constr:(@Stdlib.ZArith.BinInt.Z.add); constr:(@Stdlib.ZArith.BinInt.Z.of_nat); constr:(@Corelib.Init.Datatypes.length); constr:(@Corelib.Classes.Morphisms.trans_co_eq_inv_impl_morphism); constr:(@Corelib.Classes.RelationClasses.iff_Transitive); constr:(@OSSVerify.Proofs.boost_beast.http_request.lib.Lib.Mem.wr_at); constr:(@Corelib.Classes.Morphisms_Prop.and_iff_morphism); constr:(@Corelib.Classes.Morphisms.reflexive_proper_proxy); constr:(@Corelib.Classes.Morphisms.reflexive_reflexive_proxy); constr:(@Corelib.Classes.RelationClasses.iff_Reflexive); constr:(@Corelib.Classes.Morphisms.eq_proper_proxy); constr:(@OSSVerify.Proofs.boost_beast.http_request.lib.Lib.Mem.bytes_at_app); constr:(@Corelib.Init.Logic.eq_ind_r); constr:(@Corelib.Init.Datatypes.nat); constr:(@Corelib.Init.Nat.add); constr:(@Corelib.Classes.Morphisms.Reflexive_partial_app_morphism); constr:(@Corelib.Classes.Morphisms.respectful); constr:(@OSSVerify.Proofs.boost_beast.http_request.lib.Lib.CellsX.wr_at_app); constr:(@Stdlib.ZArith.Znat.Nat2Z.is_nonneg); constr:(@Stdlib.ZArith.BinInt.Z.le); constr:(@Corelib.Numbers.BinNums.Z0); constr:(@Corelib.Init.Datatypes.nil); constr:(@Stdlib.micromega.ZMicromega.ZArithProof); constr:(@Stdlib.micromega.VarMap.Elt); constr:(@Stdlib.micromega.VarMap.t); constr:(@Stdlib.micromega.Tauto.IMPL); constr:(@Stdlib.micromega.RingMicromega.Formula); constr:(@Stdlib.micromega.Tauto.eKind); constr:(@Corelib.Init.Datatypes.unit); constr: